= Third Universal 

The Central Rada of Ukraine has officially issued the "Third Universal", declaring the creation of a "Ukrainian People's Republic" as a federation of free peoples, though without formerly severing federal ties with Russia. Elections to an All-Ukrainian Constituent Assembly have been scheduled for next month, with all power belonging to the Central Rada and General Secretariat of Ukraine until then. 

The Universal also declares the inalienability of civil liberties in the country, the abolition of private ownership of land, and the creation of new local self-government and workers' rights. 

